{"part": {"video_part_id": 670, "bvid": "BV1vR4y1r7CT", "page_index": 0, "cid": 920719361, "title": "【再次翻唱】秋风", "duration_ms": 282000, "processing_status": "metadata_collected", "created_at": 1792025947, "updated_at": 1792025947}, "transcript": {"transcript_id": 1119, "video_part_id": 670, "source_kind": "asr-local", "language": "Chinese", "model_id": 1, "version": 1, "content_sha256": "edf9314fbb542a9d4a7553369b2a928e2894f6c181d02ed64156beeb796a627e", "created_at": 1792059229}, "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start_ms": 47200, "end_ms": 51120, "text": "白云悠悠一缕飞去，秋风起，"}, {"ordinal": 1, "start_ms": 52400, "end_ms": 56720, "text": "花儿都谢了，燕子都去了。"}, {"ordinal": 2, "start_ms": 57360, "end_ms": 61120, "text": "漫漫长夜黯然相思，秋风里，"}, {"ordinal": 3, "start_ms": 62400, "end_ms": 66240, "text": "月儿都倦了，鱼儿都睡了。"}, {"ordinal": 4, "start_ms": 68000, "end_ms": 73360, "text": "拨月剪落叶，扫"}, {"ordinal": 5, "start_ms": 74640, "end_ms": 88160, "text": "云空欲闲，在这般凄凉的午夜，苍白的语言。"}, {"ordinal": 6, "start_ms": 89600, "end_ms": 94720, "text": "这秋风无依无靠，无端无聊，"}, {"ordinal": 7, "start_ms": 96080, "end_ms": 99840, "text": "不说不笑，不哭不闹，"}, {"ordinal": 8, "start_ms": 100960, "end_ms": 109360, "text": "苦尽灭道，真难分难了。什么这么说？"}, {"ordinal": 9, "start_ms": 111200, "end_ms": 117840, "text": "无需知道，几乎明了，早就分晓。"}, {"ordinal": 10, "start_ms": 118560, "end_ms": 127360, "text": "这秋风让目光迷了傻，生出了迷惘。"}, {"ordinal": 11, "start_ms": 128320, "end_ms": 134640, "text": "你不肯说，你不肯说，"}, {"ordinal": 12, "start_ms": 135840, "end_ms": 140800, "text": "你不肯说心底的思量。"}, {"ordinal": 13, "start_ms": 140800, "end_ms": 144560, "text": "你不肯说，你不肯说，"}, {"ordinal": 14, "start_ms": 145840, "end_ms": 148800, "text": "你不肯说心底的思量。"}, {"ordinal": 15, "start_ms": 150720, "end_ms": 156960, "text": "白云悠悠一缕飞去千万里，花儿不见"}, {"ordinal": 16, "start_ms": 158320, "end_ms": 160000, "text": "了，燕子不见了。"}, {"ordinal": 17, "start_ms": 160880, "end_ms": 166960, "text": "漫漫长夜一人相思在梦里，月儿不见"}, {"ordinal": 18, "start_ms": 168400, "end_ms": 171200, "text": "了，月儿不见了。"}, {"ordinal": 19, "start_ms": 171280, "end_ms": 173360, "text": "到如今秋风拨"}, {"ordinal": 20, "start_ms": 174880, "end_ms": 181040, "text": "月剪落叶，扫云空欲闲。"}, {"ordinal": 21, "start_ms": 182426, "end_ms": 191066, "text": "只听见凄凉的午夜，苍白的语言。"}, {"ordinal": 22, "start_ms": 192506, "end_ms": 200986, "text": "若逢孤楼，沾湿长夜，天下尽无眠。"}, {"ordinal": 23, "start_ms": 202426, "end_ms": 214426, "text": "下者飘零，躺好荒野。上者挂林间。"}, {"ordinal": 24, "start_ms": 216346, "end_ms": 224026, "text": "八月秋高风怒号，卷我屋上三重茅。"}, {"ordinal": 25, "start_ms": 224346, "end_ms": 232026, "text": "如住去，归来倚杖自叹，叹西安的"}, {"ordinal": 26, "start_ms": 233066, "end_ms": 254746, "text": "光，杀千万安的光，杀千换大比天下，汉室俱欢颜，俱欢颜难存君同，人能对面为盗贼，为盗贼。"}, {"ordinal": 27, "start_ms": 256186, "end_ms": 259706, "text": "你不肯说，你不肯说，"}, {"ordinal": 28, "start_ms": 261146, "end_ms": 266186, "text": "你不肯说心底的思量。"}, {"ordinal": 29, "start_ms": 266186, "end_ms": 277786, "text": "你不肯说，你不肯说，你不肯说心底的思量。你不肯说。"}]}